# the argument of phaedo-opposites.md by rule (phil/skeleton): connectives from the parse, an atom to each clause
logic	s5
atom	let_consider_whole	then let us consider the whole question not in relation to man only but in relation to animals generally and to plants and to everything of which there is generation
atom	easier(x)	x: will be easier
atom	thing_opposit_generat	are all things which have opposites generated out of their opposites ?
atom	mean_such_thing	I mean such things as good and evil just and unjust
atom	innumerable_other_opposit	- - there are innumerable other opposites which are generated out of opposites
atom	want_show_opposit	and I want to show that in all opposites there is of necessity a similar alternation I mean to say for example that anything which becomes greater must become greater after being less
atom	true	True
atom	becom_less_once	and that which becomes less have been once greater
atom	become_less	then have become less
atom	generat_stronger_swifter(x)	x: and is generated from the stronger and the swifter from the slower
atom	better(x)	x: and is from the better
atom	more_just_unjust	the more just is from the more unjust
atom	course	of course
atom	true_opposit	and is this true of all opposites ?
atom	convinc_generat_opposit	? are we convinced that all of them are generated out of opposites
atom	universal_opposition_thing	and in this universal opposition of all things are there also two intermediate processes which are ever going on from one to the other opposite and back again where there is a greater and a less there is also an intermediate process of increase and diminution and that which grows is said to wax and that which decays to wane ?
atom	said	Yes he said
atom	many_other_process	and there are many other processes such as division and composition cooling and heating which equally involve a passage into and out of one another
atom	hold_opposit_even	and this holds of all opposites even though not always expressed in words - - they are really generated out of one another and there is a passing or process from one to the other of them ?
atom	true_repli	very true he replied
atom	sleep_opposite_wak	sleep is the opposite of waking
atom	opposite_life	Well and is there not an opposite of life ?
atom	true_said	True he said
atom	death_answer	Death he answered
atom	opposit	they are opposites
atom	generat_other	and these are generated the one from the other ?
atom	two_intermediate_process	have there their two intermediate processes also
atom	now_said_analyze(x)	x: Now said I will analyze one of the two pairs of opposites which I have mentioned to you and also its intermediate processes and you shall analyze the other to me
atom	term_sleep_other	one of them I term sleep the other waking
atom	oppo_state_wak(x)	x: is opposed to the state of waking and out of sleeping waking is generated and out of waking sleeping
atom	case_fall_asleep(x)	x: is in the one case falling asleep and in the other waking up
atom	agree	do you agree ?
atom	entirely_agree	I entirely agree
atom	suppose_analyze_life	then suppose that you analyze life and death to me in the same manner
atom	death_oppo_life	is not death opposed to life ?
atom	generat_liv	what is generated from the living ?
atom	dead	the dead
atom	say_answer_liv	I can only say in answer - - the living
atom	thing_person_ceb(x)	x: whether things or persons Cebes are generated from the dead ?
atom	clear_repli	that is clear he replied
